D7D7AF][/dim]can no longer poison a pytest-xdist worker, and the two racy ACE [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]TUI tests assert against real synchronization points instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]wall-clock luck.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ci_green_restore.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/ci_green_restore.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-gg[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-gg/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Keep the core extension parent and submodule in sync across [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sys.modules patches[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]modguard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]modguard: give the six test modules that swap or evict [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sys.modules['sase_core_rs'] a shared helper that moves the compiled [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]submodule with its parent package, and pin the re-import invariant with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a regression test.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Anchor the ACE title-refinement tests to the mount-loads sync [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]point[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]apptitle[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]apptitle: replace the single pilot.pause() in the two on-mount title [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests with a wait on _mount_state_loads_done, the barrier the title [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]write actually sits behind.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make the rapid-navigation detail test drive the debouncer [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]deterministically[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]detailrace[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detailrace: stop assuming two keypresses land inside the 150 ms debounce[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]window; control the timer the way the existing debouncer tests do and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]assert on the coalesced result.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Harden the generated sase_core_rs package init upstream[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]coreinit[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]coreinit: fix the maturin star-import template in the sase-core repo so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the package init binds the extension module explicitly instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]relying on an importlib side effect.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Confirm the restored signal end to end[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after modguard, apptitle, detailrace, coreinit[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: run the exhaustive local gate, re-run the failing legs under [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]adverse conditions, and confirm a full CI run is green.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-gg","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-gg.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-fb8559f204d9051f6b837ab45f69a6f1","started_at":"2026-08-06T16:28:00.104908+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-gg","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gg.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gg.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gg.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gg.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-gg.5","bbugy